# The M6 playthrough: a new party from New Phlan to Tyranthraxus (PlayBot, --play=).
# travel / explore use the lab's area graph (--exits=, from tools/sweep.gd's EXIT lines).
# Squares come from the area maps (tools/lab/plan.py, evmap.py) and the original's text.

log Party creation
char human fighter lg ARN
char dwarf fighter lg BRAM
char human cleric lg CEDRIC
char half-elf fighter/magic-user ng ELWEN
char human magic-user ng MARA
char halfling fighter/thief ng PIP
# Jeremy (chat 8): if the bot can't get a rolled level-1 party through the Slums, use the
# game's own MODIFY to set every ability to 18 (18/00 for fighters). Rolled parties wiped in
# the Slums in every run of chat 8 (event 7's waves, wandering kobolds on the way to the inn).
modify
begin
expect 3:0
checkpoint start

log New Phlan: arms and armour (13,8), City Hall's commissions, the inn
shop 13,8 | 0 Long Sword | 0 Banded Mail | 0 Shield | 1 Long Sword | 1 Banded Mail | 1 Shield | 2 Mace | 2 Chain Mail | 2 Shield | 3 Long Sword | 3 Leather | 4 Quarter Staff | 4 4 Dart | 5 Short Sword | 5 Leather | 5 Short Bow | 5 10 Arrow
tour 4,4 4,5
face E
step
travel 3:0
inn 4,12
checkpoint shopped

log The Slums
travel 2:20
expect 2:20
# explore leaves the fights the party can't win yet (the orcs' guards, the orcs' home,
# the hobgoblin hall) until it has trained, and trains as soon as anyone qualifies.
explore 9
checkpoint slums

log Back to New Phlan: the clerk's reward, temple, training, the inn
town
checkpoint trained1

log The Slums again: the orcs' home and the hobgoblin hall
travel 2:20
explore
# The clerk pays for the Slums after 25 won fights there (0x4ABB becomes 254).
grind 4ABB 254
checkpoint slums2
town

log Kuto's Well (8:29)
travel 8:29
explore
checkpoint kuto
town

log Podol Plaza (1:18)
travel 1:18
explore
checkpoint podol
town

log Sokal Keep by boat: the harbor master (event 2, 11,1), SOKAL, then the pier's end (event 1, 15,1)
answers 1
tour 11,1
tour 15,1
expect 4:21
explore
checkpoint sokal
travel 3:0
town

log Mendor's library and the garden (2:15)
travel 2:15
explore
checkpoint library
town

# Experience before the rest of the city: Podol Plaza's patrols interrupt every rest
# and are sized to the party.
log Podol Plaza for experience
travel 1:18
level 6
checkpoint level6
town

# The gate (event 13, 7,6) opens on ten level 6 magic-users and more: Valjevo, much later.
log 2:9 (towards Valjevo)
travel 2:9
explore 13
checkpoint area2_9
town

# South of Podol Plaza: its rests bring ghouls and wights; after 2:9 and more training.
log 4:2 (south of Podol Plaza)
travel 4:2
explore
checkpoint area4_2
town
stop
